value="esxi">VMware ESXi</option><option value="other">Other</option></select></label><p v-if="editForm.deviceType==='linux'" class="training-note">Linux / Unix uses SSH for agentless facts, neighbor tables, and firewall inventory. JIT MFA remains agent-only.</p><p v-if="editForm.deviceType==='esxi'" class="training-note">VMware ESXi uses the vSphere SOAP/REST APIs for host identity and virtual-machine inventory. Windows management and firewall enforcement are not used.</p><label v-if="editForm.deviceType==='esxi'">ESXi credential<select v-model="editForm.esxiCredentialId" required aria-label="ESXi credential"><option value="">Select ESXi credential</option><option v-for="credential in esxiCredentials" :key="credential.id" :value="credential.id">{{credential.name}} · {{credential.username}}</option></select></label><label>Additional management credentials<select v-model="editForm.credentialIds" multiple aria-label="Additional management credentials"><option v-for="credential in managementCredentials" :key="credential.id" :value="credential.id">{{credential.name}} · {{credential.username}}</option></select><small>Select SNMP or Windows credentials used for supplemental collection. Account binding is saved here.</small></label><label>Management type<select v-model="editForm.managementType" :disabled="editForm.deviceType==='esxi'"><option value="auto">Auto detect</option><option value="snmp">SNMP</option><option value="ssh">SSH</option><option value="agentless">Agentless</option><option value="agent">Agent</option><option value="api">API (SOAP / REST)</option><option value="manual">Manual</option></select></label><p v-if="error" class="error-msg" role="alert">{{error}}</p><div class="form-actions"><button type="button" class="button secondary" @click="editOpen=false;detailOpen=true">Cancel</button><button class="button primary" :disabled="busy">{{busy?'Saving…':'Save changes'}}</button></div></form></GlassWindow><GlassWindow v-model="deleteOpen" :title="`Remove ${selected?.hostname||'node'}`" width="520px"><div v-if="selected" class="form-grid"><p class="training-note">This removes the node from inventory. Historical logs and audit records remain. Remove assigned policies and their managed firewall rules first.</p><label class="account-checkbox confirm-checkbox"><input v-model="deleteConfirmation" type="checkbox"> I understand this removes the node from inventory.</label><p v-if="error" class="error-msg" role="alert">{{error}}</p><div class="form-actions"><button class="button secondary" @click="deleteOpen=false;detailOpen=true">Cancel</button><button class="button danger" :disabled="busy||!deleteConfirmation" @click="deleteNode">{{busy?'Removing…':'Remove node'}}</button></div></div></GlassWindow><div v-if="contextMenu" ref="contextMenuEl" class="asset-context-menu" role="menu" :style="{left:`${contextMenu.x}px`,top:`${contextMenu.y}px`}" @contextmenu.prevent>  <strong class="asset-context-title">{{contextMenu.node.hostname}}</strong>
