</div>
<GlassWindow v-model="enrollmentOpen" :title="`Enroll ${enrollmentNode?.hostname||'node'}`" width="580px">
  <div v-if="enrollmentNode" class="enrollment-content">
    <p>Generate a short-lived token for this discovered computer, then install the signed WinFire Agent on that computer from an elevated PowerShell session. The inventory status changes to agent mode after the agent connects.</p>
    <p v-if="enrollmentError" class="error-msg" role="alert">{{enrollmentError}}</p>
    <button v-if="!enrollmentToken" class="button primary" :disabled="enrollmentBusy" @click="createEnrollmentToken">{{enrollmentBusy?'Generating…':'Generate enrollment token'}}</button>
    <template v-else>
      <label>Enrollment token <textarea :value="enrollmentToken.token" readonly rows="2" aria-label="Enrollment token"></textarea></label>
      <div class="inline-actions"><button class="button small secondary" @click="copyEnrollmentToken">{{tokenCopied?'Copied':'Copy token'}}</button><span>Expires {{new Date(enrollmentToken.expiresAt).toLocaleString()}}</span></div>
      <p>On {{enrollmentNode.hostname}}, run <code>Install-WinFireAgent.ps1</code> with the signed agent executable and <code>{{locationOrigin}}</code> as the server URL. The installer prompts for this token without placing it on the command line.</p>
    </template>
  </div>
</GlassWindow>
<GlassWindow v-model="breakGlassOpen" :title="`Break glass · ${breakGlassNode?.hostname||'node'}`" width="580px">
  <div v-if="breakGlassNode" class="break-glass-content">
    <p class="break-glass-warning">This temporarily disables the Domain, Private, and Public Windows Firewall profiles on {{breakGlassNode.hostname}}. All inbound and outbound traffic is allowed, including traffic blocked by existing rules. A rollback task is scheduled on the host for the expiry time.</p>
    <p v-if="breakGlassError" class="error-msg" role="alert">{{breakGlassError}}</p>
    <template v-if="breakGlassState?.active"><div class="break-glass-status"><strong>{{breakGlassState.active.status}}</strong><span>Expires {{new Date(breakGlassState.active.expires_at).toLocaleString()}}</span><small>{{breakGlassState.active.reason}}</small><small v-if="breakGlassState.active.last_error" class="danger-text">{{breakGlassState.active.last_error}}</small></div><div class="inline-actions"><button class="button secondary" :disabled="breakGlassBusy" @click="refreshBreakGlass">Refresh status</button><button class="button danger" :disabled="breakGlassBusy" @click="endBreakGlass">{{breakGlassState.active.status==='activating'?'Cancel request':'Restore firewall now'}}</button></div></template>
    <form v-else class="form-grid" @submit.prevent="startBreakGlass"><label>Duration (minutes)<input v-model.number="breakGlassForm.durationMinutes" type="number" min="5" max="240" required></label><label>Reason for emergency access<textarea v-model="breakGlassForm.reason" minlength="10" maxlength="500" rows="3" required placeholder="Describe the troubleshooting need"></textarea></label><label class="account-checkbox confirm-checkbox"><input v-model="breakGlassForm.confirmed" type="checkbox"> I understand this temporarily disables the host firewall.</label><div class="form-actions"><button type="button" class="button secondary" @click="breakGlassOpen=false">Cancel</button><button class="button danger" :disabled="breakGlassBusy||!breakGlassForm.confirmed">{{breakGlassBusy?'Starting…':'Disable firewall temporarily'}}</button></div></form>
  </div>
</GlassWindow><ConfirmDialog v-model="confirmOpen" :message="confirmMessage" :busy="confirmBusy" @confirm="runConfirmation" /></div></template>

